# Versioning (caveman)

- Releases are cut by the maintainers with private tooling. Never run or invent a release command here.
- Do not bump `version` in any `composer.json`, create tags, or edit `CHANGELOG.md` by hand.
- Use conventional commits (`feat:`, `fix:`, `feat!:`); level and changelog come from them.
- Do not propose or ask for a version bump on commit/push requests.
